---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Archive from '../../components/Archive.astro';
import { getPosts } from '../../lib/posts';
const posts = (await getPosts()).filter(post => post.data.category === '프로젝트');
---
<Layout title="프로젝트"><div class="page-heading shell"><span class="eyebrow blue">SELECTED WORK & EXPERIMENTS</span><h1>생각을, 실제로.</h1><p>문제를 정의하고, 만들고, 개선하는 과정. 결과물에 담긴 선택을 함께 기록합니다.</p></div><Archive posts={posts} selected="프로젝트"/></Layout>
